Here's Breakout with 3 rows of bricks, lives, and score:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Breakout</title><style>
*{margin:0;padding:0}body{background:#111;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100vh;font-family:monospace;color:#fff}
