Here's an RPG engine with tile map, inventory system, quest tracking, and NPC dialogue — single HTML file:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Om RPG</title><style>
*{margin:0;padding:0}body{background:#000;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100vh;font-family:monospace;overflow:hidden}
